  "notes": "Local three-epoch paired smoke experiment, not formal convergence or 99% acceptance. Real/legacy/focused sampling is 46/45/63 per epoch. Choose checkpoints only on held-out synthetic validation; no real generalization claim. Existing deployed models remain unchanged."
